From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Giedrius <agnutritions@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 21:46:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Issue a stream ticket when playback info is requested

PlaybackInfo is authenticated, so it is the point where a client has proved who
it is. Minting the ticket here is what lets the stream endpoints below stay
reachable to the clients that cannot send credentials.
---
 Jellyfin.Api/Helpers/MediaInfoHelper.cs       | 53 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../Helpers/MediaInfoHelperTests.cs           |  5 +-
 2 files changed, 56 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

